{"id": 1545, "title": "New friend", "level": "Beginner", "hsk_tags": ["HSK1"], "slug": "new-friend", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/1545_new-friend.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["李小姐是我今天认识的朋友。我今天在咖啡店吃东西，但是没钱。李小姐说可以借给我，我有点儿不好意思，但是我很想吃东西，就借了她的钱。我们一起吃饭，发现我的妈妈和她的爸爸是同学！我们都很高兴，想明天也一起吃东西。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["李小姐是我今天認識的朋友。我今天在咖啡店吃東西，但是沒錢。李小姐說可以借給我，我有點兒不好意思，但是我很想吃東西，就借了她的錢。我們一起吃飯，發現我的媽媽和她的爸爸是同學！我們都很高興，想明天也一起吃東西。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["Lǐ xiǎo jiě shì wǒ jīn tiān rèn shi de péng you。 wǒ jīn tiān zài kā fēi diàn chī dōng xi， dàn shì méi qián。 Lǐ xiǎo jiě shuō kě yǐ jiè gěi wǒ， wǒ yǒu diǎn r bù hǎo yì si， dàn shì wǒ hěn xiǎng chī dōng xi， jiù jiè le tā de qián。 wǒ men yī qǐ chī fàn， fā xiàn wǒ de mā ma hé tā de bà ba shì tóng xué！ wǒ men dōu hěn gāo xìng， xiǎng míng tiān yě yī qǐ chī dōng xi。"], "english_paragraphs": ["Miss Li is a new friend I met today. I was at a café and wanted something to eat, but I didn’t have any money. Miss Li offered to lend me some. I felt a little embarrassed, but I really wanted to eat, so I borrowed the money. We ate together and discovered that my mother and her father were classmates! We were both very happy and wanted to eat together again tomorrow."], "english_full": "Miss Li is a new friend I met today. I was at a café and wanted something to eat, but I didn’t have any money. Miss Li offered to lend me some. I felt a little embarrassed, but I really wanted to eat, so I borrowed the money. We ate together and discovered that my mother and her father were classmates! We were both very happy and wanted to eat together again tomorrow.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Lǐ\" data-defn=\"surname Li\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">李</span><span class=\"tr\">李</span><rt>Lǐ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xiǎo jiě\" data-defn=\"young lady / miss / (slang) prostitute\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">小姐</span><span class=\"tr\">小姐</span><rt>xiǎo jiě</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" d